      "desc:8": "Safes in structures are locked - and you can lock your own containers too. Right-click a lockable container with a §6Padlock§r to lock it. Only a §6Key§r with the matching pin pattern opens it again, although a skilled thief with a screwdriver and bobby pins may still pick it.\n\nThe §6Rusty Padlock§r is the easiest to pick, the steel §6Padlock§r is considerably harder.\n\nThe §3Locksmith Table§r copies the pin pattern from the item in its first slot onto the key or padlock in the second, so you can make spare keys or a set of locks that all open with one key.",
